cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite the A2A-UAV dataset.
title: 'A2A-UAV: A Multimodal Air-to-Air Dataset for UAV Detection and Identification'
type: dataset
authors:
- name: A2A-UAV contributors
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: A2A-UAV contains processed RGB, panoramic, thermal, RF spectrogram
  and radar products organized by retained sample and canonical recording assignments.
